{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Symphony of the Stars is a JRPG inspired by the SNES era that sees a lost outsider, Myst, thrown into a war between the gods of the zodiac! Explore and battle your way through puzzle box dungeons as you seek out powerful relics that grant the use of both combat and overworld skills. Delve into themes of duality and personal growth with Myst as he weighs the preservation of his past against the embrace of an uncertain future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187490/extras/BattleCustomization.png?t=1753238543\" /></div><strong>Customize your characters in battle by learning and equipping devastating skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187490/extras/BattleGif_Bordered.gif?t=1753238543\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187490/extras/OverworldSkills.png?t=1753238543\" /></div><strong>Use skills to interact with the world outside of battle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187490/extras/AurorasGrace_Bordered.gif?t=1753238543\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187490/extras/ChallengingPuzzles.png?t=1753238543\" /></div><strong>Solve a variety of puzzles to earn items, upgrade characters, and complete dungeons!</strong></p><p class=\